    "title": "» Defendant Charged in Neighbor's Fatal Beating Rejects Plea Deal - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Editor’s Corner ,\n23 hours ago A defendant rejected a plea to involuntary manslaughter at a hearing before DC Superior Court Judge Todd Edelman on Jan. 23. Jose Ramos, 35, is charged with second-degree murder for his alleged involvement in the fatal beating of his neighbor, Eduardo Cruz, 57, at their apartment building on the 3700 block of Georgia Avenue, NW, on Jan. 25, 2022. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
